OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners vow to fight bottling
OL,4,Aplant appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have vowed to continue
OL,7,Ftheir fight against controversial plans
OL,8,Fto expand a North Yorkshire bottled
OL,9,Fwater factory.
OL,11,FA proposal to extend Harrogate Spring
OL,12,FWater's bottling plant was rejected by
OL,13,Fcouncil planners in April, but the
OL,14,Fcompany has said it will appeal against
OL,15,Fthat decision.
OL,17,FDame Judi Dench and Dame Joanna Lumley
OL,18,Fwere among those who objected to the
OL,19,Foriginal plans, and campaigners have
OL,20,Fsaid they will raise funds to contest
OL,21,Fthe new appeal.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
