OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners vow to fight bottling
OL,4,Aplant appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors said that the proposed
OL,7,Flandscaping at the factory in Harlow
OL,8,FMoor Road would not adequately
OL,9,Fcompensate for the loss of existing
OL,10,Ftrees, and that the appearance of the
OL,11,Fextension lacked "local
OL,12,Fdistinctiveness".
